=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ MAKE @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt GNU make @VERSION@ for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt GNU make is free software under the GNU GPL, version 3 or later.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [MAKE.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for GNU make
    At system startup: to define MAKE$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:MAKE$STARTUP.COM
    For each user: to define the make and gmake commands, add this line to LOGIN.COM:
    $ @MAKE$ROOT:[000000]MAKE$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE MAKE removes the product and deassigns MAKE$ROOT.
